WEBVTT

00:14:57.579 --> 00:15:01.228
because they are always gravitating
towards increased choices

00:15:01.252 --> 00:15:02.489
and possibilities.

00:15:02.513 --> 00:15:05.142
And we are aware of the price;

00:15:05.166 --> 00:15:07.405
we pay a price for that,
but we're aware of it,

00:15:07.429 --> 00:15:10.384
and generally, we will pay the price
for increased freedoms,

00:15:10.408 --> 00:15:11.796
choices and opportunities.

00:15:12.305 --> 00:15:15.013
Even technology wants clean water.

00:15:15.037 --> 00:15:19.218
Is technology diametrically
opposed to nature?

00:15:19.242 --> 00:15:22.100
Because technology
is an extension of life,

00:15:22.124 --> 00:15:24.967
it's in parallel and aligned
with the same things

00:15:24.991 --> 00:15:26.294
that life wants.

00:15:26.874 --> 00:15:29.049
So that I think technology loves biology,

00:15:29.073 --> 00:15:30.624
if we allow it to.